          ],
          "correctOptionId": "3",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px;   background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">The diagram according to the given conditions is</p>\n\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px;   background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/06/F1_Sagar_Madhu_18.06.21_D1.png\" style=\"width: 484px; height: 406px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px;   background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Distance between DE is 2m, which is in even number, while other points are having distance in odd number.</p>\n\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px;   background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Hence, <strong>DE does not belong to the group.</strong></p>",
          "topic": "Test"
