          ],
          "correctOptionId": "5",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px;   background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">The diagram according to the given conditions is</p>\n\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px;   background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/06/F1_Sagar_Madhu_18.06.21_D1.png\" style=\"width: 484px; height: 406px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px;   background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Total distance covered by Tom&nbsp;&rarr; 5 + 2 + 4 = 11 m</p>\n\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px;   background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Hence, <strong>Tom has to cover 11m to reach point F</strong>.</p>",
          "topic": "Test"
