        {
          "id": "60d06f8cdb2eb19da400a6e0",
          "questionNumber": 8,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "What is the shortest distance between V and Q?",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "164",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "&radic;164m",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "464",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "&radic;535m",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "&radic;464m",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "5",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p>We have drawn the figure according to the information given in the question,</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/06/F1_Sagar%20Saxena_Anil_22.06.21__D6.png\" style=\"width: 364px; height: 347px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>By using the Pythagorean Theorem,</p>\n\n<p>VQ<sup>2&nbsp;</sup>= PQ<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span>&nbsp;+ UP<span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em;font-size:10.5px;\">2</span></p>\n\n<p>VQ<sup>2</sup>&nbsp;= 8<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2&nbsp;</span>+ 20<span style=\"position: relative; line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; top: -0.5em; font-size:10.5px;\">2</span></p>\n\n<p>VQ<span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>=&nbsp;&radic;464</p>\n\n<p>VQ&nbsp;= &radic;464m</p>\n\n<p>Hence,&nbsp;&radic;<strong>464m</strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">is the shortest distance between V&nbsp;and Q.</span></p>",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
